    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26229" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφόρ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>plundering, stealing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προβάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PTeb.</u>
					72.239
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cor.</u>
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cic.</u>
				14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>evaporation, dissipation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Olymp.
				<u>in Mete.</u>
				145.14
			</span></i>; <i>perspiration,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Fam.</u>
				16.18.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τῶν ἱδρώτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
				</span></i>
			<i>Fr. inc.</i><i><span class="en">
				149
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>dispersion, discussion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.919
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>exhaustion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cael.Aur.
				<u>CP</u>
				1.15
			</span></i>,al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>dubitation, perplexity,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.389a
			</span></i>.</div>
